% [VERIFIED 2026-09-14] Publisher's own repository (source code; no DOI or proceedings record exists).
%   File list and history from the GitHub REST API,
%   https://api.github.com/repos/odota/core/commits?path=processors/processTeamfights.js (24 commits,
%   2016-03-10 to 2023-12-02), and the file itself at commit e2e44328032e5ce81879f2a6ec3ee73e9120e736
%   (committed 2018-10-21; url below).  At that commit: line 10 teamfightCooldown = 15; line 17 a fight
%   opened by the first hero death e gets start = e.time - teamfightCooldown; line 45 it closes at the first
%   interval event 15 or more after the last hero death; line 57 keeps fights with deaths >= 3; there is no
%   spatial condition.  processors/createParsedDataBlob.js at the same commit (line 102) stores the result as
%   parsedData.teamfights.  The next change to the file (b6e810a, 2022-09-20) only reformats it, so this
%   version stood in the repository from 2018-10-21 to 2022-09-20, a span that contains the CoG 2021
%   conference of Tot et al. (2021-08-17 to 2021-08-20, Crossref event field).  Tot et al. do not name a
%   version, and the repository cannot show what OpenDota's servers ran.  The three rules are unchanged
%   at 5ed1f21 (2016-03-10), b6e810a, a1d40ea (2023-12-01) and 3b6a7cd (2023-12-02, renamed to
%   processTeamfights.mjs).  Commit 570cfc0 (2024-01-07) removed the file
%   from odota/core; the same logic is in odota/parser processors/processTeamfights.mjs on master (read
%   2026-09-14).  The file does not state the unit of e.time.  OpenDota's parser at 44ec63a (2020-06-10,
%   src/main/java/opendota/Parse.java lines 353 and 469) sets time with Math.round of the combat-log
%   timestamp and of the game-rules field m_fGameTime; that the unit is seconds is inferred from those
%   field names and is not stated in either file.
@misc{opendota2018processteamfights,
  author       = {{OpenDota}},
  title        = {{processTeamfights.js}: team-fight processor of the {OpenDota} core},
  howpublished = {GitHub repository odota/core, commit e2e4432},
  year         = {2018},
  url          = {https://github.com/odota/core/blob/e2e44328032e5ce81879f2a6ec3ee73e9120e736/processors/processTeamfights.js},
  note         = {Source file, lines 10--57. Accessed: Sep. 14, 2026}
}

